OL,3,AOlivia Dean accused of copying Bill
OL,4,AWithers' Just The Two of Us
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lawsuit names Dean's record label
OL,7,FCapitol Records, parent company
OL,8,FUniversal Music Group and her
OL,9,Fpublishing companies as the defendants.
OL,10,FIt does not seek damages from the
OL,11,Fsinger herself or her co-writers
OL,12,FBastian LangebC&k and Max Wolfgang.
